A warm tropical evening scene in Singapore's Marina Bay area, rendered in the style of Vincent van Gogh with swirling expressive brushstrokes and bold impasto technique. Two empty chairs sit at a small café table overlooking the water, suggesting an anticipated meeting between colleagues. The iconic Singapore skyline glows with amber and golden lights reflected in rippling harbor waters, painted with Van Gogh's characteristic dynamic spiraling energy. Lush tropical plants frame the foreground with thick, animated brushwork in deep greens and teals. The night sky swirls with stars and clouds in vivid blues and purples, reminiscent of Starry Night. Steam rises from two untouched coffee cups on the table, rendered with expressive curling strokes. The overall mood conveys warm hospitality, international collaboration, and the excitement of creative work in an exotic location.
